commits.message:
feat(drive): add the Excalidraw editor behind drive.excalidraw.enabled

Add a self-hosted Excalidraw editor for .excalidraw files, gated by the
drive.excalidraw.enabled flag:

- create/open drawings from the add menu, the favorites sidebar and direct
  links, in private, shared-drive and public-share contexts;
- store the scene in the file binary (no metadata duplication), autosave it
  on an interval/visibility/unmount, and open read-only shares in view mode;
- read and write through the shared-drive scope, seed the scene source from
  the instance URL, and follow the Cozy theme for dark mode;
- self-host the fonts/assets for a strict CSP and serve them same-origin in
  dev and under /public;
- wire the file type into navigation (icon, route, type) and the locales.

